{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["对以色列的最后审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以法莲支派在以色列地位崇高，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们一开口，人都恐惧颤抖。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他们却祭拜巴力，以致犯罪而亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今他们作恶日甚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为自己铸造神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用银子精工制作偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但这统统不过是匠人之作。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人们议论他们说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“那些献祭的人竟亲吻牛犊偶像！”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们像晨雾，如转瞬即逝的朝露，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像麦场上飞旋而去的糠秕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像窗口冒出的轻烟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“自从你们离开埃及以来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就是你们的上帝耶和华。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外，你们不可有别的神明；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以外，你们也没有别的救主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾在干旱的旷野照顾你们，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你们得到喂养，便得饱足。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们饱足以后，就心高气傲，忘记了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要像狮子攻击你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如豹子潜伏在路旁；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像一头失了幼崽的母熊冲向你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撕裂你们的胸膛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像母狮吞噬你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像凶猛的野兽撕碎你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"“以色列啊，你要灭亡了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你抵挡我，抵挡你的帮助者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾求我为你设立君王和首领，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在拯救你的君王在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各城管理你的首领在哪里呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在愤怒中赐给你君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也在愤怒中废黜他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“以法莲的过犯已被记录在册，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的罪恶已被储存入库。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"临产的阵痛要临到他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他是毫无智慧的孩子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"分娩之时却不离开母腹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要解救他们脱离阴间的权势吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要救赎他们脱离死亡吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"死亡啊，你的灾殃在哪里？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"阴间啊，你的毁灭在哪里？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不施怜悯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽管以法莲在众弟兄中最强盛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从耶和华而来的东风要从沙漠刮来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使清泉枯竭，水井干涸。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他储藏的一切珍宝都要被掳去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒玛利亚人背叛了他们的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要担当自己的罪过。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们将丧身刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的孩子要被摔死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"孕妇要被剖腹。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}